  "bodyHash": "ZoDBF0/Vi9Y=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/md78MGbEfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><h1>机械动力：货币模组</h1><p>Numismatics 是一款全新的货币模组，它不仅提供了易于使用的简易商店系统，还为你的红石资本主义梦想留下了足够的发挥空间。</p><h2>功能特性</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/vendor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/creative_vendor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>售货机</h3><p>快速购买或出售物品，专为紧凑型玩家商店设计。</p><p>创造模式版本允许服务器管理员设置无限补货的商店。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/bank_terminal.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>银行终端</h3><p>访问您的虚拟银行账户以存入和取出硬币。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/andesite_depositor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/brass_depositor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>投币器</h3><p>设置价格后，一旦玩家通过背包中的硬币或使用卡支付，投币器就会发出一个红石刻的脉冲信号。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>硬币</h3><p>本模组的核心，提供6种不同面值的硬币供您选择。</p><table style=\"width:70.5514%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">刺轮币</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">斜齿币</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">链轮币</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">齿轮币</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">冠轮币</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.3823%\">日轮币</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">1 刺轮</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">8 刺轮</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">16 刺轮</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">64 刺轮</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">8 齿轮</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.3823%;text-align:center\">64 齿轮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/spur.png\" alt=\"刺轮币\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/bevel.png\" alt=\"斜齿币\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/sprocket.png\" alt=\"链轮币\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/cog.png\" alt=\"齿轮币\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/crown.png\" alt=\"冠轮币\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.3823%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/sun.png\" alt=\"日轮币\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/red_card.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/red_id_card.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>银行卡和身份卡</h3><p>银行卡可以放入投币器或售货机中，使资金直接转入关联账户。此外，在售货机或投币器上使用银行卡，会直接从账户中扣款，而不是从背包中扣除硬币。</p><p>身份卡用于允许其他玩家访问货币模组的受保护方块（售货机、投币器和烈焰银行家），方便您向商业伙伴授予访问权限。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/blaze_banker.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>烈焰银行家</h3><p>一个银行账户不足以满足您的<del>避税</del>商业需求？创建另一个账户，并使用身份卡让您的商业伙伴能够取款。",
